    code: pageScript,
    note: '<code class="font-mono text-sm">_smoothScroll</code> loads Lenis on first use, one for the whole page. Lenis eases the real page scroll, so <code class="font-mono text-sm">_parallaxScroller</code> and the other scroll utils follow it as is. Its <code class="font-mono text-sm">scroll</code> event gives the scroll speed, <code class="font-mono text-sm">stop()</code> and <code class="font-mono text-sm">start()</code> pause it. With reduced motion turned on, Lenis is off and the page scrolls as normal.'
}) }}

